ed\", \"label\": \"Government Other Specify\", \"text\": \"This government-specific text does not feed sector, county, or project implementation reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"disabled\", \"label\": \"Government Other Amount\", \"text\": \"This government-specific amount does not feed the main sector report output.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Scope\", \"text\": \"Shows whether the PBO is national or international, which is used in grouped reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Counties Of Operation\", \"text\": \"Lists where the PBO operated during the reporting period for county-level reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project Sector\", \"text\": \"Captures the sector for each implementation row, which is a core sector-report dimension.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project County\", \"text\": \"Feeds county-level project analysis even when the edit page locks the visible control.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project Beneficiaries\", \"text\": \"Supports beneficiary totals and sector impact summaries.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project Spending Per County\", \"text\": \"Provides county-level spending values for the sector report output.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project Duration\", \"text\": \"Helps describe the duration of implemented projects in analysis outputs.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Project Completion Status\", \"text\": \"Used to summarize whether projects are complete, ongoing, or planned.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Payment Categories\", \"text\": \"Supports spending analysis by expenditure type.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Kenya Payments\", \"text\": \"Provides the Kenya-based payment values used in financial summaries.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Other Country Payments\", \"text\": \"Adds non-Kenya spending values to payment reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Assets\", \"text\": \"Contributes to asset-based rollups and organization profile summaries.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Donations\", \"text\": \"Feeds donation totals and funding-source reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Grants\", \"text\": \"This grants-awarded section is locked on edit and is not part of the main sector-report extraction focus.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_focus\", \"label\": \"Staff And Volunteer Totals\", \"text\": \"Supports workforce and volunteer summary outputs tied to the report.\"}, {\"category\": \"conditional\", \"label\": \"Audit fields\", \"text\": \"Collects audit firm and auditor details only for audited organizations, but these are not core sector-report fields. Enabled only when Audited is Yes.\"}, {\"category\": \"conditional\", \"label\": \"Government tax waiver section\", \"text\": \"Avoids collecting government waiver fields when that section does not apply and keeps non-sector data out of the main reporting path. Disabled when the government sections are marked inactive.\"}, {\"category\": \"conditional\", \"label\": \"Officials section\", \"text\": \"Keeps governance role structure controlled while still allowing review, but this section is outside the main sector-report extraction focus. Some official-role cells are read-only or disabled by design.\"}, {\"category\": \"conditional\", \"label\": \"Project implementation detail fields\", \"text\": \"Project sector, county, spending, beneficiaries, duration, and completion data still matter for sector reporting even when edit mode locks the visible widgets. Some visible controls are locked on edit even though their stored values still support sector reports.\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.2.1 Submission of Annual Reports\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.2.1 Submission of Annual Reports\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.2.2 Audited Accounts\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.2.2 Audited Accounts\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.2.3 Funds Received\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.2.3 Funds Received\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.1 Sectors of Operation\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.1 Sectors of Operation\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.10 Employment\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.10 Employment\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.11 Collaborations and Networking\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.11 Collaborations and Networking\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.3 Utilisation of Funds on Projects\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.3 Utilisation of Funds on Projects\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.4 Counties of Operation\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.4 Counties of Operation\"}, {\"category\": \"sector_heading\", \"label\": \"2.3.6 Project Implementation per Counties\", \"text\": \"Sector report heading from Annual NGO Sector Report 2019/2020: 2.3.6 Project Implementation per Counties\"}, {\"category\": \"note\", \"label\": \"Note 1\", \"text\": \"On the current edit page, only Start Date and PBO Name should be treated as required fields.\"}, {\"category\": \"note\", \"label\": \"Note 2\", \"text\": \"For sector reporting, the main collection focus is on sectors, counties, project implementation rows, spending, beneficiaries, scope, and related financial summary fields.\"}, {\"category\": \"note\", \"label\": \"Note 3\", \"text\": \"Many disabled fields are disabled because they are reference-only, out of scope for the sector report, or intentionally locked in edit mode.\"}, {\"category\": \"note\", \"label\": \"Note 4\", \"text\": \"Some project fields may look disabled on the edit page but still correspond to stored project data that feeds sector reporting.\"}, {\"category\": \"note\", \"label\": \"Note 5\", \"text\": \"This page is using cached field-help knowledge for local guidance.\"}]','2026-03-31 12:56:50');
